CLIENTS C1, C2

C1 SEND PASS 1234
C1 SEND NICK Alice
C1 SEND USER alice 0 * :Alice

C2 SEND PASS 1234
C2 SEND NICK Bob
C2 SEND USER bob 0 * :Bob

C1 SEND JOIN #42
C1 SEND MODE #42 +i
C2 F SEND JOIN #42

C1 SEND INVITE Bob #42
C2 WAIT_RECV :Alice!* INVITE Bob :#42

C2 SEND JOIN #42
C1 WAIT_RECV :Bob!* JOIN #42

C1 SEND KICK #42 Bob :Get out!
C2 WAIT_RECV :Alice!* KICK #42 Bob :Get out!

C2 EXPECT_CONNECTED
